	<feature id="flow_field" name="Regional Flow Fields">
		<script>systems/flow_field.gd</script>
		<runtime>scripts/phase0_run.gd</runtime>
		<api>rebuild,rebuild_with_blocker,best_passable_next,ranked_passable_neighbors,last_visit_count</api>
		<regions>expand_regions,corridor_regions_between,_flow_allowed_regions,flow_dirty_regions</regions>
		<fallback>_greedy_step_toward prefers cardinals then diagonals with openness tie-break; _pick_flow_route_cell uses ranked_passable_neighbors + occupancy; dead-ends request batched flow refresh immediately</fallback>
		<refresh>_refresh_player_flow rebuilds player_flow on region change, player_flow_stale (mining near player), and after base-flow rebuild while hostiles are active</refresh>
		<perf>Region-local `_region_distance` maps (576 cells per allowed region) replace flat width×height buffers in sparse mode. Partial `_rebuild_base_flows(false,false,mining_partial)` rebuilds bases intersecting `flow_dirty_regions` only; dirty/partial and encounter mobilize use light region caps (MINING_FLOW_REGIONS) instead of MAX_FLOW_REGIONS=36. `brood_carrier_flows` preserved on partial rebuild; mining bypasses `BASE_FLOW_COMBAT_THROTTLE` and the removed 80-enemy re-defer cliff. `TERRAIN_FLOW_REBUILD_DELAY` tuned to 0.45s. Carrier site search deferred via `pending_brood_carrier_requests` (one/frame, immediate flush on spawn).</perf>
		<note>_spider_has_viable_route now treats base_flow, player_flow, explorer_flow, greedy fallback, and low locomotion_stall as viable routing so _reposition_unreachable_wave_spiders and _wave_spawn_pressure_count no longer mass-teleport/pathing mobs that are already moving toward the player. Relocate capped at MAX_WAVE_RELOCATIONS_PER_TICK (3), blocked within WAVE_RELOCATE_PLAYER_SAFE_RADIUS (200px), requires WAVE_RELOCATE_MIN_STALL (1s), tries _recover_stuck_spider before teleport. Spawn-cap stall rebuilds flows first instead of immediate recall+relocate.</note>
		<tests>flow_field_test,regional_flow_field_test,flow_local_rebuild_test,route_tactics_test,mob_locomotion_test,mob_flow_behavior_test,combat_pressure_test</tests>
	</feature>
