	<feature id="combat_vfx" name="Combat Projectile VFX">
		<script>systems/combat_vfx.gd</script>
		<runtime>scripts/phase0_run.gd</runtime>
		<generator>tools/import_combat_textures.py,tools/import_enemy_projectiles.py</generator>
		<note>FX sheets (hazard/lob/cyst/status) use gutter+largest-component cuts via `import_enemy_projectiles.py --fx-only`; biome artillery keeps equal thirds.</note>
		<art_prompts>docs/art-prompts/pack-enemy-projectiles.md,docs/art-prompts/pack-enemy-projectile-fx.md</art_prompts>
		<source_sheets>assets/art/mobs/projectiles/{Tunnel,Hive,Bunker,Crystal,Foundry,Sulfur,Iron}.png,assets/art/mobs/projectiles/{bulwark_lob,guardian_cyst,hazard_thermal,hazard_spore}_source_sheet.png,assets/art/mobs/projectiles/status_*_source.png</source_sheets>
		<texture_packs>assets/art/combat/projectile_*.png,muzzle_*.png,laser_*.png,flame_*.png,rocket_*.png,acid_*.png,impact_*.png,recoil_*.png,tunnel_spore_*.png,hive_venom_*.png,bunker_arc_*.png,crystal_arc_*.png,foundry_thermal_*.png,sulfur_corrosive_*.png,iron_kinetic_*.png,enemy_lob_*.png,enemy_cyst_*.png,hazard_*.png,status_*.png</texture_packs>
		<branding>assets/branding/crawl_brawl_logo.png,assets/branding/crawl_brawl_icon.png</branding>
		<draw>_draw_bullets,_draw_enemy_hazard_patch,_draw_player,_draw_player_status_overlay,_draw_player_weapon,_player_tool_pose,_draw_combat_impacts,_draw_laser_segment_chain,_load_combat_textures,_spawn_combat_impact,_combat_feedback,_draw_oriented_combat_sprite,_projectile_texture_id_for_bullet,_projectile_size_for_bullet,_projectile_trail_texture_for_bullet,_assign_enemy_projectile_visuals,_enemy_muzzle_puff,held_weapon_texture_id</draw>
		<note>COMBAT_SHEETS crop grids in import_combat_textures.py were transposed vs the actual sheet layouts (e.g. coded 2x3 for an actual 3x2 sheet), so crop_grid_cell sliced diagonal fragments -- every sprite came out a near-blank sliver and USE_IMPORTED_COMBAT_FX was quarantined off. Fixed grid dims by visual inspection of each archived sheet, added key_magenta_with_spill to import_combat_sheets, re-ran the importer, enabled the flag.</note>
		<note>Muzzle flash alpha was computed as muzzle_flash / 0.14 (railgun's own duration) for every weapon, so pistol (0.06s) peaked at 43% opacity and SMG (0.035s) at 25% -- both effectively invisible mid-combat. Added muzzle_flash_max set alongside muzzle_flash per weapon so alpha now normalizes against each weapon's own flash duration.</note>
		<note>Timed combat impacts, laser segment tiling, sentry muzzles, weapon recoils, held-weapon overlays (`held_weapon_texture_id`), and imported reticles now render through CombatVfx mappings with procedural spark fallback.</note>
		<note>Enemy projectile FX alive pass: type-driven spin/wobble/trail, WHITE modulate, typed hazard/status overlays, muzzle glob puff + enemy_pop impacts, flamethrower eviction skips player_only hazards.</note>
